{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. Cinematic Martial Arts Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/fb88c8efbbdba968ac1f318efa72d0eb.poster.avif?t=1758800389\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/fb88c8efbbdba968ac1f318efa72d0eb.webm?t=1758800389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/fb88c8efbbdba968ac1f318efa72d0eb.mp4?t=1758800389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No static slashing here! Experience <strong>bone-crunching combat</strong> with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face-to-face melee exchanges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split-second offense/defense transitions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lethal counterattacks exploiting enemy vulnerabilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. Ultimate Move Spectacles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/0087b263dc4738e0523160114e719454.poster.avif?t=1758800389\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/0087b263dc4738e0523160114e719454.webm?t=1758800389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/0087b263dc4738e0523160114e719454.mp4?t=1758800389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sect boasts a <strong>showstopping ultimate ability</strong>\u2014unleash dazzling animations to decisively end battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3.</strong>\u00a0<strong>Strategic Resource Management &amp; Build Freedom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/0eda5675be55597ddef6f695f881414d.poster.avif?t=1758800389\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/0eda5675be55597ddef6f695f881414d.webm?t=1758800389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/0eda5675be55597ddef6f695f881414d.mp4?t=1758800389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited funds per round</strong>: Carefully curate purchases from shops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Load capacity system</strong>: Optimize equipment and relics within weight limits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four-Manual Synergy</strong>: Equip four manuals to unlock world-shattering combos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4.Fate System - Defy Fate with Dice &amp; Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/fb65d0986e3bded3857efff841255d29.poster.avif?t=1758800389\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/fb65d0986e3bded3857efff841255d29.webm?t=1758800389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/fb65d0986e3bded3857efff841255d29.mp4?t=1758800389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All martial sects share one unified Fate System (randomized skills). Players primarily obtain additional Fate Cards by forging relics. Before each battle, roll multiple 6-sided dice and use the results to activate Fate Cards, unleashing their effects in the upcoming combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5. Forge Divine Weapons via Relic Synthesis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/01a38ba3dfcf21cbf02f3db1f2cb536f.poster.avif?t=1758800389\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/01a38ba3dfcf21cbf02f3db1f2cb536f.webm?t=1758800389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/01a38ba3dfcf21cbf02f3db1f2cb536f.mp4?t=1758800389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every relic is a crafting ingredient. Visit the blacksmith to fuse relics into legendary weapons\u2014<strong>inheriting base stats</strong> while gaining <strong>new unique skills</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>6. Relics Boost Stats, Manuals Reshape Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/964f4710617608076c298b38838dc710.poster.avif?t=1758800389\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/964f4710617608076c298b38838dc710.webm?t=1758800389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/964f4710617608076c298b38838dc710.mp4?t=1758800389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ Jianghu Relics</strong> (White/Blue/Purple/Gold tiers) to enhance stats and unleash item skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60 Martial Manuals</strong> to either empower or completely transform your sect\u2019s abilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>7. Diverse Sects, Unique Stories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/122638e13f5ae4215b60586dbda61be7.avif?t=1758800389\" data-has-big width=800 height=317 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each sect offers distinct skills, manuals, and <strong>fully voiced backstories</strong>. Unlock their tales to explore characters\u2019 heroic deeds and quirky daily lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist now and prepare to carve your legend in the Jianghu!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Email: <a href=\"mailto:wystan30@gmail.com\">wystan30@gmail.com</a></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3378130?t=1758800389","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3378130?t=1758800389","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/2bca3809a4d30d2c6fe6c8605c22f41b87aa5a9f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758800389","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/2bca3809a4d30d2c6fe6c8605c22f41b87aa5a9f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758800389","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"des